        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "For groups of 25 or more people, a museum charges \\$21 per person for the first 25 people and \\$14 for each additional person. Which function *f* gives the total charge, in dollars, for a tour group with *n* people, where *n* ≥ 25?"
        }
